r or public danger; nor shall any person be subject for the same offence to be twice put in jeopardy of life or limb; nor shall be compelled in any criminal case to be a witness against himself, nor be deprived of life, liberty, or property, without due process of law; nor shall private property be taken for public use, without just compensation.","in_force_since":"1791-12-15","status":"in force","applies_to":["US"],"official_url":"https://constitution.congress.gov/constitution/amendment-5/","alt_urls":[{"label":"National Archives transcription","url":"https://www.archives.gov/founding-docs/bill-of-rights-transcript"}],"source_ids":{"const":"Amend. V","text_sha1":"489de719b6c470c634999a30cdb0a40bd3f59917"},"d_method":"entry into force of the Constitution (1789-03-04) / ratification of the amendment; never amended","issues":["us.constitution.due-process"],"xrefs":[],"interps":["us-scotus-602-899","us-ca8-37-f4th-520","us-scotus-582-47","us-scotus-576-86","us-ca8-765-f3d-815","us-ca8-744-f3d-577","us-scotus-570-744","us-ca8-641-f3d-957","us-ca8-563-f3d-378","us-ca8-372-f3d-946","us-ca8-362-f3d-461","us-scotus-533-53","us-scotus-523-420","us-ca8-68-f3d-208","us-scotus-507-292","us-scotus-483-587","us-ca8-809-f2d-508","us-scotus-476-340","us-scotus-465-728","us-ca8-702-f2d-710","us-ca8-699-f2d-438","us-scotus-445-23","us-scotus-443-282","us-scotus-443-76","us-scotus-434-47","us-scotus-430-787","us-scotus-430-313","us-scotus-430-199","us-scotus-429-181","us-scotus-427-495","us-scotus-422-749","us-scotus-420-636","us-scotus-417-628","us-scotus-411-677","us-scotus-401-815"],"axes":["family"],"outside":[{"engine":"courtlistener","label_fr":"CourtListener — Cour suprême des États-Unis et 8e circuit","label_en":"CourtListener — U.S. Supreme Court & Eighth Circuit","url":"https://www.courtlistener.com/?q=%22U.S.%20Const.%20Amend.%20V%22&type=o&court=scotus%20ca8","note_fr":"","note_en":"","manual":false},{"engine":"justia","label_fr":"Justia (recherche générale)","label_en":"J